%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"}}%%
stateDiagram
direction LR
title DMA 描述符队列
state "分配描述符<br/>Descriptor" as Alloc
state "提交 DMA" as Dispatch
state "回收环形缓冲区" as Reap
[*] --> Alloc
Alloc --> Dispatch:::busy : doorbell<br/>内核批量提交 DMA 描述符
Dispatch --> Reap : IRQ / 校验设备写回的状态位，随后释放映射页
Reap --> [*]
note left of Alloc : IOMMU 映射对齐到页边界
note right of Reap
    先确认 DMA fence，再移动 head 指针。
    环形缓冲区采用 acquire 屏障。
end note
classDef busy fill:#c1e8ff,stroke:#3485ae,color:#154b65
classDef ring fill:#e4edda,stroke:#6b893d,color:#3d5628
class Reap ring
